description: Markdown style for the guide, the README, and the docs
globs: docs/**/*.md, README.md, AGENTS.md, .github/**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---

# Documentation

- Plain words, short sections, and a table or a list when it scans better.
- No em dashes.
- Write for a senior engineer reading this repo for the first time.
- Document paths that exist today. Link to a doc instead of copying it.
- Use relative links inside this repo.
- Keep [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) to its five sections. Do not add agent roles, shipping routines, or deploy steps.
- When behaviour changes, update the doc that describes it.
